menuconfig MODULES_FC_WATCHDOG
	bool "fc_watchdog"
	default n
	depends on PLATFORM_NUTTX
	---help---
		Hardware watchdog fed only while the flight control loop runs
		(gyro and motor outputs updating). Currently backed by the TI AM67
		RTI8 watchdog (NuttX CONFIG_AM67_RTI8_WDT), whose expiry cuts the
		motor outputs from a FIQ.
